            "type": "text",
            "content": "As my father walked into the room, my brother cowered slightly (轻微地畏缩). He sensed that he had done something _37_. I could see that he had _38_ my father's new hymnal and scribbled (乱涂) in it. Now he was waiting for his punishment."
